{"steam_appid":3042190,"steam_name":"Nomad Idle","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3042190/787571/47f9893abab2fc9b1b64a1a47aa800c93cfb9fcf/1750823118/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1731931312","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257074600/bebefce0ae2c01a73ef642e09c936ff16079f022/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1731931312","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/ss_e805b35a272b5901363c55d92fb8022e970417a5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767920045","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/ss_2aef417a37f09b6a2b52ff30524211984db0dce6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767920045","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/ss_d72c8890adfbaf76221e7b1ddfb09dc9baa0ce74.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767920045","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/ss_795f67438fc0b53e882dc8811c92044ff5099b80.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767920045","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/ss_85b91763b50d84114d3a5d9cede3730f963acec0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767920045"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut down hordes of enemies <strong>automatically</strong> in <strong>Nomad Idle</strong>, a spin-off of <i>Nomad Survival</i>. Engage in an expansive storyline, make impactful decisions, and grow stronger through various gameplay features that gradually unlock as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/extras/bad3d84c14b7c51be952b4fe1dcb3ed3.poster.avif?t=1767920045\" width=664 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/extras/bad3d84c14b7c51be952b4fe1dcb3ed3.webm?t=1767920045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/extras/bad3d84c14b7c51be952b4fe1dcb3ed3.mp4?t=1767920045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nomad Idle</strong> is an idle game with a defined end and is not designed to be endless. However, that does not mean the game is short or lacks depth. In <strong>Nomad Idle</strong>, you can expect to have access to the following as you play through the game and unlock more features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Level up and earn Stat Points</strong> which may be distributed within 7 unique Stats, allowing you to create a build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Discover, craft, and upgrade Equipment</strong> in order to make yourself stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Conjure Summons</strong> to aid you in battle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Select Passive Skills to be automatically used in battle</strong>, further defining your build. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Choose a Character,</strong> defining your active abilities and special perks for your playthrough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/extras/a05070ede7ef7934b3907ac4bb360fa1.poster.avif?t=1767920045\" width=664 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/extras/a05070ede7ef7934b3907ac4bb360fa1.webm?t=1767920045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/extras/a05070ede7ef7934b3907ac4bb360fa1.mp4?t=1767920045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nomad Idle</strong> is an <strong>idle game</strong>, meaning that it mostly <strong>plays on its own</strong>. Your character moves and attacks enemies all on their own, but it <strong>can be played actively</strong> by making use of character-specific skills and abilities. Playing actively in this way is <strong>entirely optional</strong> and not mandatory, but can be effective in speeding up your progress or help you overcome challenges.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB VRAM Graphics Cards<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GB or Higher VRAM Graphics Cards</li></ul>","genres":["Indie"],"developers":["The Fox Knocks"],"publishers":["The Fox Knocks"],"release_date":"4 Apr, 2025"}